{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Desktop Companion</i></strong> is a customizable desktop assistant that lets you bring life to your screen. Import your own <strong>2D</strong> or <strong>3D</strong> models and turn them into interactive companions that live right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/b2d317aa05525ee7b3f0ff3a87c15705.poster.avif?t=1761750084\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/b2d317aa05525ee7b3f0ff3a87c15705.webm?t=1761750084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/b2d317aa05525ee7b3f0ff3a87c15705.mp4?t=1761750084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Models \u2013 Add your own 2D gifs or full 3D characters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Interactions \u2013 Drag, throw, and play with your companion directly on your screen. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations \u2013 Add life with custom animations. Animate idle states, movements, or reactions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity &amp; Physics \u2013 Enable gravity for fun and realistic motion. Let your model bounce around or fall naturally based on your desktop layout.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop - You can download others companions and share yours all within the Workshop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/2ceae1224b8c8a4a0fb92bf648f1d755.poster.avif?t=1761750084\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/2ceae1224b8c8a4a0fb92bf648f1d755.webm?t=1761750084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/2ceae1224b8c8a4a0fb92bf648f1d755.mp4?t=1761750084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong>: The 2D and 3D models shown in the screenshots and trailer are for demonstration purposes only. They are not included in the application and serve only to showcase functionality.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920410?t=1761750084","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920410?t=1761750084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/af20a286bae5b06a78c74ad256c0038205632e63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761750084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/af20a286bae5b06a78c74ad256c0038205632e63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761750084","categories":[{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Desktop Companion</i></strong> is a customizable desktop assistant that lets you bring life to your screen. Import your own <strong>2D</strong> or <strong>3D</strong> models and turn them into interactive companions that live right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920410/extras/b2d317aa05525ee7b3f0ff3a87c15705.poster.avif?